function tone(freq=330,duration=.08,type='sine'){if(!audioOn)return;try{audioCtx??=new (window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)();const o=audioCtx.createOscillator(),g=audioCtx.createGain();o.type=type;o.frequency.value=freq;g.gain.setValueAtTime(.035,audioCtx.currentTime);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audioCtx.currentTime+duration);o.connect(g).connect(audioCtx.destination);o.start();o.stop(audioCtx.currentTime+duration);}catch{}}
